{"4134110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cozy Holiday", "steam_appid": 4134110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Cozy Holiday</strong> is a heartwarming co-op game about teamwork, fun, warmth, and the joy of doing something kind together. Spend time in a snowy cabin preparing a cozy home and a delicious festive dinner for your guests. Decorate, cook, and make everything perfect for the holiday evening.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134110/extras/fb3ad02d51825cd393bec3a7287dad80.poster.avif?t=1766051476\" width=656 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134110/extras/fb3ad02d51825cd393bec3a7287dad80.webm?t=1766051476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134110/extras/fb3ad02d51825cd393bec3a7287dad80.mp4?t=1766051476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">When the preparations are done, step outside into a quiet winter town and help deliver gifts to its residents. Work together to plan your route, avoid small obstacles, and spread cheer across the snowy streets.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134110/extras/20ef18073594853bc07b6d150c6c6c8b.poster.avif?t=1766051476\" width=664 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134110/extras/20ef18073594853bc07b6d150c6c6c8b.webm?t=1766051476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134110/extras/20ef18073594853bc07b6d150c6c6c8b.mp4?t=1766051476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every moment in <strong>Cozy Holiday</strong> is designed to bring players closer, whether you’re cooking by the fire, carrying presents through the snow, or simply enjoying the calm together. It’s a peaceful, family-friendly experience that celebrates kindness, cooperation, and cozy winter magic. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134110/extras/04892cecf2297dbdf1362fbf7b3e3b68.poster.avif?t=1766051476\" width=664 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134110/extras/04892cecf2297dbdf1362fbf7b3e3b68.webm?t=1766051476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134110/extras/04892cecf2297dbdf1362fbf7b3e3b68.mp4?t=1766051476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Cozy teamwork</strong> – Prepare a festive cabin together, decorate rooms, and cook a delicious holiday dinner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Deliver joy</strong> – Team up to deliver gifts across a snowy town. Balance, navigate, and cooperate to make everyone’s holiday brighter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Peaceful winter world</strong> – Explore a charming snowy environment filled with lights, laughter, and Christmas atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple, rewarding tasks</strong> – Cook, tidy up, and make your cabin feel like home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>No rush, no stress</strong> – Designed for relaxing play and warm cooperation, perfect for families and friends.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Made for coziness and fun</strong> – Every activity encourages communication, care, and shared joy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Whether you’re playing with your partner, your kids, or your best friends, <strong>Cozy Holiday</strong> brings everyone together to make the Christmas special.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134110/extras/4def97149abca99767b06f0a33da9f3a.avif?t=1766051476\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>(You can find the Discord link on the right side of the screen)</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Cozy Holiday</strong> is a heartwarming co-op game about teamwork, fun, warmth, and the joy of doing something kind together. Spend time in a snowy cabin preparing a cozy home and a delicious festive dinner for your guests. Decorate, cook, and make everything perfect for the holiday evening.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134110/extras/fb3ad02d51825cd393bec3a7287dad80.poster.avif?t=1766051476\" width=656 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134110/extras/fb3ad02d51825cd393bec3a7287dad80.webm?t=1766051476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134110/extras/fb3ad02d51825cd393bec3a7287dad80.mp4?t=1766051476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">When the preparations are done, step outside into a quiet winter town and help deliver gifts to its residents. Work together to plan your route, avoid small obstacles, and spread cheer across the snowy streets.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134110/extras/20ef18073594853bc07b6d150c6c6c8b.poster.avif?t=1766051476\" width=664 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134110/extras/20ef18073594853bc07b6d150c6c6c8b.webm?t=1766051476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134110/extras/20ef18073594853bc07b6d150c6c6c8b.mp4?t=1766051476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every moment in <strong>Cozy Holiday</strong> is designed to bring players closer, whether you’re cooking by the fire, carrying presents through the snow, or simply enjoying the calm together. It’s a peaceful, family-friendly experience that celebrates kindness, cooperation, and cozy winter magic. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134110/extras/04892cecf2297dbdf1362fbf7b3e3b68.poster.avif?t=1766051476\" width=664 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134110/extras/04892cecf2297dbdf1362fbf7b3e3b68.webm?t=1766051476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134110/extras/04892cecf2297dbdf1362fbf7b3e3b68.mp4?t=1766051476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Cozy teamwork</strong> – Prepare a festive cabin together, decorate rooms, and cook a delicious holiday dinner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Deliver joy</strong> – Team up to deliver gifts across a snowy town. Balance, navigate, and cooperate to make everyone’s holiday brighter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Peaceful winter world</strong> – Explore a charming snowy environment filled with lights, laughter, and Christmas atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple, rewarding tasks</strong> – Cook, tidy up, and make your cabin feel like home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>No rush, no stress</strong> – Designed for relaxing play and warm cooperation, perfect for families and friends.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Made for coziness and fun</strong> – Every activity encourages communication, care, and shared joy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Whether you’re playing with your partner, your kids, or your best friends, <strong>Cozy Holiday</strong> brings everyone together to make the Christmas special.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134110/extras/4def97149abca99767b06f0a33da9f3a.avif?t=1766051476\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>(You can find the Discord link on the right side of the screen)</p>", "short_description": "Cozy Holiday is a cooperation game for two players, where you can relax and enjoy winter adventures together. Explore charming places, deliver gifts and complete small tasks in a cozy Christmas world. Create memories with your friend, partner, child or a grandparent.", "supported_languages": "English, Czech, Slovak", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134110/70b0c141815f9d06cde8788289b7fdd262ac15c5/header.jpg?t=1766051476", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134110/e3a4e7c7d84eb3f862e66d829fc0c1cd357e4eed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766051476", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134110/e3a4e7c7d84eb3f862e66